ass":512,"line":895},24,[510,897,898],{"class":713},"        customerBindings",[510,900,499],{"class":524},[510,902,717],{"class":524},[510,904,734],{"class":520},[510,906,723],{"class":524},[510,908,910],{"class":512,"line":909},25,[510,911,912],{"class":524},"    ));\n",[510,914,916],{"class":512,"line":915},26,[510,917,918],{"class":524},"}\n",[492,920,921,922,929],{},"Register that instance in your application's container. Fluent does not ship a database driver or migrations. Laravel users should use ",[923,924,928],"a",{"href":925,"rel":926},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fvatly\u002Fvatly-laravel",[927],"nofollow","vatly-laravel"," instead of writing this wiring.",[931,932,934],"h2",{"id":933},"choose-the-billable","Choose the billable",[492,936,937,938,941,942,945,946,948],{},"Your billable is the user, team, company, or tenant that pays. There is no ",[496,939,940],{},"Billable"," interface or required base model. Give Fluent a ",[496,943,944],{},"CustomerProfile"," with a Vatly customer ID, or use ",[923,947,68],{"href":202}," to create and bind one to your host ID.",[492,950,951],{},"A profile is input, not a stored customer. Supplying only its email to a checkout builder does not create or bind a customer. Create the customer explicitly, or use an empty profile for an anonymous checkout.",[931,953,955],{"id":954},"save-local-billing-state","Save local billing state",[957,958,959,972],"table",{},[960,961,962],"thead",{},[963,964,965,969],"tr",{},[966,967,968],"th",{},"Contract",[966,970,971],{},"Your implementation does",[973,974,975,985,994,1003,1034],"tbody",{},[963,976,977,982],{},[978,979,980],"td",{},[496,981,561],{},[978,983,984],{},"Maps host IDs to Vatly customer IDs in both directions; records unattributed customers.",[963,986,987,991],{},[978,988,989],{},[496,990,627],{},[978,992,993],{},"Finds by Vatly ID, stores a subscription, updates it.",[963,995,996,1000],{},[978,997,998],{},[496,999,605],{},[978,1001,1002],{},"Finds by Vatly ID, stores an order, updates it.",[963,1004,1005,1009],{},[978,1006,1007],{},[496,1008,649],{},[978,1010,1011,1012,1015,1016,1019,1020,1019,1023,1019,1026,1029,1030,1033],{},"Records received deliveries and cleans up old audit rows. It does not skip duplicate processing. The recorded ",[496,1013,1014],{},"object"," has the customer's personal data (",[496,1017,1018],{},"customerDetails",", ",[496,1021,1022],{},"billingAddress",[496,1024,1025],{},"shippingAddress",[496,1027,1028],{},"mandate",") redacted to ",[496,1031,1032],{},"[redacted]","; keys and nesting are kept.",[963,1035,1036,1040],{},[978,1037,1038],{},[496,1039,583],{},[978,1041,1042,1043,1046],{},"Dispatches typed events to your listeners. ",[496,1044,1045],{},"NullEventDispatcher"," is available if you need no listeners.",[492,1048,1049,1050,1053,1054,1057,1058,1061],{},"Repositories return your objects implementing ",[496,1051,1052],{},"SubscriptionInterface"," or ",[496,1055,1056],{},"OrderInterface",". Wrap existing host records rather than copying them; see ",[923,1059,1060],{"href":226},"Host tables",". Reader and writer contracts are also available separately when a component needs only one role.",[492,1063,1064,1065,1068,1069,1072,1073,1076],{},"Enforce unique Vatly IDs in storage and binding uniqueness in both directions. Accept ",[496,1066,1067],{},"hostCustomerId: null"," on store data: anonymous payments may arrive before a customer is linked. Entity ",[496,1070,1071],{},"store()"," methods may return ",[496,1074,1075],{},"null"," when a record genuinely does not belong to your integration. Throw on a storage failure so the delivery can retry.",[931,1078,1080],{"id":1079},"apply-partial-updates-correctly","Apply partial updates correctly",[492,1082,1083,1086,1087,1090,1091,1094,1095,1098],{},[496,1084,1085],{},"Store*Data"," and ",[496,1088,1089],{},"Update*Data"," carry local persistence data. Amounts are integer cents with a separate currency. SDK resources and money-bearing webhook events use ",[496,1092,1093],{},"Money"," objects instead; use ",[496,1096,1097],{},"toCents()"," at your own persistence boundary.",[492,1100,1101,1102,1104,1105,1086,1108,1111],{},"In updates, ",[496,1103,1075],{}," normally means leave the stored value alone. Subscription updates have explicit ",[496,1106,1107],{},"clearEndsAt",[496,1109,1110],{},"clearMandate"," flags. A non-null mandate replaces both its method and masked identifier; do not keep an old card's last four digits when a new mandate has no identifier.",[492,1113,1114,1115,1118,1119,1122],{},"Persist ",[496,1116,1117],{},"testmode"," from store data and expose it through the entity's ",[496,1120,1121],{},"isTestmode()",". Select the matching key in your application; storing the flag does not switch keys automatically.",[492,1124,1125,1128,1129,1132],{},[496,1126,1127],{},"DerivesSubscriptionState"," implements the subscription state predicates from ",[496,1130,1131],{},"getEndsAt()",": no end date means active, a future end date means a valid grace period, a past date means ended. These predicates are not a full entitlement policy for trials, failed payments, or disputes. Your app decides access.",[931,1134,1136],{"id":1135},"add-optional-records","Add optional records",[492,1138,1139,1141,1142,1019,1145,1148,1149,1152,1153,1156],{},[496,1140,498],{}," also accepts ",[496,1143,1144],{},"refunds",[496,1146,1147],{},"chargebacks",", and ",[496,1150,1151],{},"orderLines",". Refund and chargeback repositories enable their persistence reactions. Order lines need your order writer to persist the ",[496,1154,1155],{},"StoreOrderData::$lines"," supplied on a new paid order; wiring a line reader alone does not save lines.",[492,1158,1159,1160,1162,1163,1166,1167,1171],{},"Use ",[923,1161,50],{"href":218}," for transactions and ",[923,1164,1165],{"href":222},"Event flow"," for the event-to-storage mapping. Field details live in the ",[923,1168,301],{"href":1169,"rel":1170},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference",[927],".",[1173,1174,1175],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D47;--shiki-default:#F78C6C;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-w